<title>SPAIN: Spanish Feb car registrations up 1.33 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>Spanish Feb car registrations up 1.33 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish car registrations rose 1.33 percent in February to 73,939 units compared with 72,964 in the same month last year, provisional data from the National Carmakers' Association ANFAC showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>The increase in the first two months of the year was 9.92 percent and registrations so far this year are 2.48 percent above the average for the same period over the last five years.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
